# PS2Recomp engine — stateless. Games live in separate per-game repos that this
# engine is pointed at; nothing game-specific is tracked here.

# Toolchain: per-game PS2Recomp clones live under tools/<game>/PS2Recomp (cloned +
# built by scripts/01_setup.sh <game_dir>). Each game gets its own clone so builds
# never collide and the clone can be re-pulled/re-cloned per game.
/tools/*/
/tools/ghidra*

# Scratch (build logs, run logs)
/tmp

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
sccache.log
.claude/skills/ps2recomp-fix-next-crash/__*
